Print the Cueson executable version as one undecorated line.

Usage:
  cueson [global options] version

Options:
  None.

Global options:
  -q, --quiet  Suppress informational and success diagnostics.
  --silent     Suppress every non-error diagnostic.
  --no-color   Disable diagnostic color.
  -h, --help   Show help.
  --           End option processing; following paths and operands remain literal.

Streams:
  stdout  The executable version followed by one LF.
  stderr  Errors only.

Exit codes:
  0  Command or explicit help completed successfully; warnings may be present.
  1  An accepted operation failed during processing, cancellation, or runtime I/O.
  2  Command syntax, an operand, an option, or a pre-execution requirement was invalid.

Examples:
  cueson version
